  "id": "places",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "20 marine place polygons (18 NOAA National Marine Sanctuaries, 1 MarineRegions EEZ, 1 ProtectedSeas MPA) as GeoParquet and PMTiles, for computing place statistics against the erddap/ collections. Provenance: the 18 sanctuary boundaries are the official NOAA ONMS shapefile downloads listed at https://sanctuaries.noaa.gov/library/imast_gis.html (zones unioned to one multipolygon per site, made valid, transformed to EPSG:4326 from NAD83 or, for Florida Keys, NAD27); the EEZ is MarineRegions MRGID 8439 and the MPA is ProtectedSeas PSGID 939. Each row records its download in source_url and source_date. Built by catalog/build_places.R.",
